# Armbian's edge kernel has no screen on Recore: it is built without simpledrm,
# which the panel needs (U-Boot's framebuffer is handed over to it). Rebuild
# builds the same kernel with simpledrm built in and hosts it on feeds. Armbian's
# own package carries a higher version, so without this apt would offer it as an
# upgrade and take the screen away.
#
# 900 is above the default 500, so the feeds package is the candidate. It is
# below 1000 on purpose: a board that already has another edge kernel is not
# downgraded behind its owner's back.
Package: linux-image-edge-sunxi64 linux-dtb-edge-sunxi64
Pin: origin feeds.iagent.no
Pin-Priority: 900
